{"obsah":"<p>After several days of individual training, a Saturday on the Trial bike and 3 exhibitions awaited me and the guys. It started in the morning in Prague at the Craft Run, which happened to be supported by Gatorade. Here, for now, just with my colleague Lukáš Valný. You could tell people were a bit scared of the weather, but as it warmed up the number of visitors grew, and our show after Honza Weber already had a pretty decent crowd.</p>\n\n<p>We quickly threw everything into the car and set off to meet Martin Šimůnek in Doksy near Česká Lípa, where the traditional meet of Škoda cars and car tuning was taking place. The organisers slowly squeezed us through the packed camp to the spot where the main participants of our show were already gathering – kids from a children's home for abused and neglected children. Hopefully Martin, Lukáš and I brought a little joy into their lives. I mustn't forget my son Marty, who rode his first exhibition here, and Nikolka and Elinka, who helped and took photos the whole time.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The exhibition ran long, so we had barely packed the obstacles before we were on the way to Letňany in Prague, where the Pivobraní beer festival was on. In a really packed atmosphere we launched an exhibition for all the beer lovers and fans of the various goodies on offer at the stalls. This time we rode the exhibition at a slightly more action-packed pace.</p>\n\n<p>V.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2FIMG_3021.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2FIMG_3021.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"193799\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-con